## 9. Save Aggregation Result into Another Collection

Used `$match` to find students with CGPA greater than or equal to 8.5 and `$out` to save the result into `highCGPAStudents`.

```javascript
db.studentsAgg.aggregate([
    {
        $match: {
            cgpa: { $gte: 8.5 }
        }
    },
    {
        $out: "highCGPAStudents"
    }
])
```

### Output

```text
```

The aggregation creates/replaces the `highCGPAStudents` collection.

Students satisfying the condition:

```text
Aastha  - 8.6
Kavya   - 9.3
Ananya  - 8.8
Karan   - 8.5
Manav   - 9.0
Dev     - 9.2
```

